  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/property/englishTranslationOfTheGreekOnTheOriginalSealOfTheUniversityIs%22ALampBurningAndShining%22Or%22ALampShiningBrightly%22AReferenceToSt.JohnTheBaptist(seeJohn535).ALaterSealOfTheUniversityUsesALatinPhraseThatMayBeRendered%22christianEducationPerfectsTheSoul%22.Motto">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">English translation of the Greek on the original seal of the University is " a lamp burning and shining" or " a lamp shining brightly" a reference to St. John the Baptist (see John 5:35). A later seal of the University uses a Latin phrase that may be rendered "Christian education perfects the soul".
