  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://dbpedia.org/property/thisRadioStationWasOriginallyStartedByWilliamMcgrath.AfterHeHadMadeAllThePreparationsForTheStation,AForeignerNamedMangoLebrunastBrokeIntoTheBuildingInCentralOntarioAndForcedMcgrathToGiveMangoTheDeedToTheBuildingAndStation.MangoLebrunastFamilyStillOwnsTheStation.Image">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">This radio station was originally started by William McGrath. After he had made all the preparations for the station, a foreigner named Mango LeBrunast broke into the building in central Ontario and forced McGrath to give Mango the deed to the building and station. Mango Lebrunast family still owns the station.

  image</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
